   "title": "Mass and stiffness change frequency in opposite directions.",
   "left": {
    "term": "Mass",
    "text": "**Mass resists changes in motion**. Increasing the moving mass makes acceleration and reversal slower when the restoring stiffness stays fixed."
   },
   "right": {
    "term": "Stiffness",
    "text": "**Stiffness determines the restoring response to displacement**. Increasing it gives a stronger return force for the same displacement when mass stays fixed."
   },
