   "answer": "**Both endpoints must remain displacement nodes**. Whole numbers of half-waves fit those two conditions.\n\nFitting more half-waves into the same length makes the wavelength shorter. With the wave speed held fixed, shorter wavelengths correspond to higher frequencies, producing whole-number multiples of the fundamental.",
