   "answer": "Early contributions depend on downstream computations. **Solving the downstream gradients first makes their results reusable for earlier connections**.\n\nThe algorithm computes downstream error information first and reuses it to determine the effects of earlier weights. This is the dynamic-programming idea of solving smaller dependent problems before the larger problems that contain them.",
